<title>SPAIN: Spain's ENCE in deal with Metsa-Botnia.</title>
<headline>Spain's ENCE in deal with Metsa-Botnia.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish paper firm ENCE (Empresa Nacional de Celulosas SA) said on Wednesday it had reached a commercial agreement with Finnish group Metsa-Botnia to operate in the British market.</p>
<p>According to the deal, the two firms will jointly operate a commercial firm in United Kingdom through ENCELL Ltd and Botnia Pulps Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
